| Condition | Constant used | Wire bytes |
|---|---|---|
| Subscription session + RESP v2 | `CmdStrings.SUSCRIBE_PONG` | `*2\r\n$4\r\npong\r\n$0\r\n\r\n` (array form) |
| All other cases | `CmdStrings.RESP_PONG` | `+PONG\r\n` (simple string form) |

