### 1. The main router misses → `defaultRoute` (fastify.js:627)

Every incoming HTTP request is handled by `wrapRouting` → `router.routing(req, res)` (the main `find-my-way` router). When no registered route matches, `find-my-way` calls its configured `defaultRoute` callback. That callback is:

```js
