### What it does
The function takes a `&str` and returns a `String` that is a safe glob pattern representing the literal input. It iterates over every character and **brackets** any glob meta-character so it is treated literally by the glob engine:

| Input char | Output |
|---|---|
| `?` | `[?]` |
| `*` | `[*]` |
| `[` | `[[]` |
| `]` | `[]]` |
| `{` | `[{]` |
